  {
    "id": "update_1783189774559_utx2qrfnz",
    "title": "Flowtime Version 2.3.24 is now available!",
    "slug": "update-from-instagram-dax_cw3nt4z",
    "description": "",
    "body": "This one is all about getting started faster.\n\n\u2728 New Quick Start Templates to help you jump into common workflows with a single tap.\n\n\ud83d\udd14 Notification Templates so you can reuse reminder setups instead of creating them from scratch every time.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Flowtime is now available in 10 languages, making it accessible to even more people around the world.\n\nSmall improvements, but together they remove a lot of friction.\n\nThanks to everyone who\u2019s been sharing feedback and ideas. Every update is shaped by the people using the app. \u2764\ufe0f",
    "platform": "instagram",
    "status": "published",
    "originalUrl": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DaX_cW3Nt4Z/",
    "externalPostId": "DaX_cW3Nt4Z",
    "tags": [
      "instagram"
    ],
